        "Background": "Karis is the daughter of Dromar d'Ori, a renowned bounty hunter for the Galactic Peace Legion. When the elusive criminal Shadowman killed her father, Karis dedicated herself to hunting him down, eventually tracking him to an unfamiliar, underdeveloped world: Earth. She's accompanied by Arasuni, a GPL-issued assistant robot.",
        "Personality": "Quick-witted and sharp-tongued, Karis tends to act before she thinks. Earth's customs leave her thoroughly out of her depth, and she has a short fuse — especially when teased about her appearance."
